Problem is not in including commented line . Try running your code with that line you will still not be able to pass last test case. This is all because there is problem in your code while calculating and updating dist[nrow][ncol] . Take example, dist[nrow][ncol] is 6, your pcost is 3 , you go inside if with hope that pcost till now with current path is less so can go on this next step nrow,ncol with either this max value in this path or if diff=difference bwtween row,col and nrow,ncol is less than dist[nrow][ncol] even if diff is greater than pcost .
So you have skipped checking this part . Update your code with this and then dry run it for such an example :
int diff=max(abs(heights[nrow][ncol]-heights[row][col]),pcost);
dist[nrow][ncol]=min(dist[nrow][ncol],diff);
pq.push({dist[nrow][ncol],{nrow,ncol}});
Hope this help you!!

